git version 2.34.1
--- 1. global identity, used by every repository on this computer
user.name=DevUser
user.email=devuser@example.com
init.defaultbranch=main
--- 2. a project that must use a different identity
--- who wins inside this project? (and where each value comes from)
file:~/.gitconfig	user.name DevUser
file:~/.gitconfig	user.email devuser@example.com
file:.git/config	user.name ProjectUser
file:.git/config	user.email projectuser@example.com
--- the value Git will really use
ProjectUser
--- the identity lands on every commit
ProjectUser <projectuser@example.com>
